# GeT-RM reference material, Coriell ID GM09301. GeT-RM consensus diplotype:
# reported as "*1/*1 (*1/*17)" in CDC's table -- the base call from assays
# that don't test the *17 promoter variant was *1/*1; once the 2 methods
# that do test *17 (a lab-developed RFLP assay and a lab-developed TaqMan
# assay) are included, the fuller, more complete consensus is *1/*17. This
# fixture uses the fuller *1/*17 call, per this project's own "use the most
# complete testing available" principle. Source: Pratt VM et al. 2010,
# J Mol Diagn 12:835-846 (PMID 20889555), as reproduced in CDC's
# public-domain data table
# (https://www.cdc.gov/lab-quality/media/pdfs/2024/08/CYP2C19_GeneConsensus.pdf,
# retrieved 2026-08-18). Genotype below constructed from this project's own
# dbSNP-confirmed defining-variant coordinates (genes/cyp2c19.py), not
# redistributed from GeT-RM/Coriell/CDC directly.
#CHROM	POS	ID	REF	ALT	QUAL	FILTER	INFO	FORMAT	SAMPLE1
